  "limits": [
    "Both-ends starts low on each invocation/grant and alternates after full-target tile completion. Overflow does not advance the tile.",
    "Up to two contiguous adaptive work units may interleave; both ends can finish one unit. Sizing uses each unit's own active time, excluding opposite-end execution and pause.",
    "A restart resets the phase to low on the exact saved complement; submission sequence need not match an uninterrupted run.",
    "Job/configuration/table identity, schema 7, protocol, receipts and capabilities are unchanged; scalar --order and coordinator block claims stay separate.",
    "Both kernels tested on HIP/CUDA; group-8 spot checks cover all eight visible ordinals. No exhaustive kernel-by-ordinal product, fleet scaling or new partition claim.",
    "Five focused host sanitizer gates; no claim of complete application or device-code sanitizer coverage.",
    "No new GPU arithmetic or throughput claim. Dance, additional random traversal semantics and alternative minikey orders remain pending.",
    "Public fixtures only; no enrollment credentials or journal databases archived."
